<p>I pull up a video on my phone, how to walk in women's shoes, and stand in the middle of the apartment reading the advice back to myself. Shorter stride. Hips sway naturally if you let them. Weight on the balls of the feet.</p>

<p>I try it, walking from the bedroom to the kitchen. Shorter steps. Let the hips move. Don't force it, don't fight it.</p>

