<p>I change into panties and an old t-shirt for sleeping, his, an XL that hangs to mid thigh on me like a sleep dress. It's soft from a hundred washes, and it smells like detergent and nothing else, since every trace of his body chemistry is long gone, replaced by mine.</p>

